---
// EthicsChecklistMap: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="ecm">
  <div class="ecm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four pipeline stages with gold boxes underneath: at collection drop raw personal data and aggregate telemetry, at storage use short expiry and per-user keys, at scoring measure subgroup error rates, at decision give plain-language reasons and an appeal path.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Where each habit goes in the pipeline</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi thói quen nằm ở đâu trong đường ống</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>The five habits from the table below, pinned to the stage they protect.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Năm thói quen trong bảng bên dưới, gắn vào khâu mà chúng bảo vệ.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="70" width="185" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={44} y={95} size={24} />
      <text x="66" y="100" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Collect</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Thu thập</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 205 95 L 240.0 95.0" /><polygon points="245,95 238.7,98.0 238.7,92.0" /></g>
      <g class="arrow gold"><path d="M 112 120 L 112.0 131.0" /><polygon points="112,136 109.0,129.7 115.0,129.7" /></g>
      <rect x="20" y="136" width="185" height="54" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="32" y="158" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Drop raw personal</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ dữ liệu cá nhân thô</tspan></text>
      <text x="32" y="174" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>data at ingestion</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngay khi thu</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="200" width="185" height="54" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="32" y="222" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Aggregate telemetry,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gộp telemetry, không</tspan></text>
      <text x="32" y="238" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>no persistent IDs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gắn ID cố định</tspan></text>
      <rect x="245" y="70" width="185" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={269} y={95} size={24} />
      <text x="291" y="100" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Store</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Lưu trữ</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 430 95 L 465.0 95.0" /><polygon points="470,95 463.7,98.0 463.7,92.0" /></g>
      <g class="arrow gold"><path d="M 337 120 L 337.0 131.0" /><polygon points="337,136 334.0,129.7 340.0,129.7" /></g>
      <rect x="245" y="136" width="185" height="54" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="257" y="158" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Short expiry on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Log hành vi có hạn</tspan></text>
      <text x="257" y="174" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>behavioral logs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xóa ngắn</tspan></text>
      <rect x="245" y="200" width="185" height="70" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="257" y="222" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>One key per user:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi người một khóa:</tspan></text>
      <text x="257" y="238" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>delete the key to erase</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hủy khóa là xóa</tspan></text>
      <text x="257" y="254" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>(crypto-shredding)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>(crypto-shredding)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="470" y="70" width="185" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={494} y={95} size={24} />
      <text x="516" y="100" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Score</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Chấm điểm</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 655 95 L 690.0 95.0" /><polygon points="695,95 688.7,98.0 688.7,92.0" /></g>
      <g class="arrow gold"><path d="M 562 120 L 562.0 131.0" /><polygon points="562,136 559.0,129.7 565.0,129.7" /></g>
      <rect x="470" y="136" width="185" height="86" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="482" y="158" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Track false positives</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đo dương/âm tính giả</tspan></text>
      <text x="482" y="174" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>and negatives per</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>theo từng nhóm, không</tspan></text>
      <text x="482" y="190" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>subgroup, not just</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ độ chính xác</tspan></text>
      <text x="482" y="206" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>overall accuracy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tổng thể</tspan></text>
      <rect x="695" y="70" width="185" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={719} y={95} size={24} />
      <text x="741" y="100" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>4. Decide</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4. Quyết định</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow gold"><path d="M 787 120 L 787.0 131.0" /><polygon points="787,136 784.0,129.7 790.0,129.7" /></g>
      <rect x="695" y="136" width="185" height="70" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <text x="707" y="158" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Plain-language reasons,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lý do bằng lời dễ hiểu,</tspan></text>
      <text x="707" y="174" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>a manual review queue</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hàng chờ xét thủ công</tspan></text>
      <text x="707" y="190" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>and an appeal path</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và đường khiếu nại</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Read each column top to bottom: the stage on top, the habit that keeps it from causing harm underneath.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đọc từng cột từ trên xuống: khâu ở trên, thói quen giúp khâu đó không gây hại ở dưới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ecm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ecm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ecm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ecm text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ecm .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ecm .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecm .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ecm .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ecm .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ecm .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ecm .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ecm .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecm .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecm .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecm .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ecm .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecm .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecm .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .ecm .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ecm .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ecm .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ecm .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecm .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ecm .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecm .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ecm .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .ecm .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ecm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
